# Secrets. ardia-studio-app/server.py:_load_dotenv() reads ardia-studio-app/.env
# for the live Gemini/Anthropic key. .vercelignore kept it out of the deployment
# bundle but nothing kept it out of a commit — one `git add -A` would have
# published a working provider key.
.env
*.env
.env.*
!.env.example
